			"notes": "## Anti Magick 0.1.2\n\n  Stable maintenance release for Minecraft 1.21.1 and NeoForge.\n\n  ### Fixed\n\n  - Fixed a NeoOrigins add-on mixin crash during mod loading.\n  - Fixed disconnects caused by `/categories` when more than 32 categories were installed.\n  - Fixed suppression checks for modded items used on blocks and entities.\n  - Fixed an invalid vanilla entity tag.\n\n  ### Improved\n\n  - Added integrations for Ars Nouveau, Companions, Bonfires, Etherology, NeoOrigins, The Aether, Deeper and Darker, The Twilight Forest, Bosses of Mass Destruction, and Staff Mod.\n  - Added targeted suppression for Ars spell paths, active NeoOrigins powers, mod portals, and supported boss summons.\n  - Updated Russian Wiki and Modrinth publishing templates.\n\n  ### Requirements\n\n  - Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.1\n  - NeoForge 21.1.x\n  - Java 21\n  - Core and installed add-ons are required on both client and server."
		},
